# Multi-tissue acquisition inputs and records. Small, hand-curated, and the only
# statement of which ENCODE files the joint model's context is built from --
# exactly the provenance that was missing for the breast tracks, so it is
# tracked rather than left on one machine.
!data/multitissue_picks.tsv
!data/multitissue_acquisition_plan.json
!data/tcga_normal_cohort_survey.json

