# Main-text figures gathered to the repo root by
# scripts/94_collect_manuscript_figures.sh so main_revised.tex can find them.
# Every one is a copy of a generated file under results/; *.png is already
# ignored above, the PDFs are not.
/uncertainty_scale_stability.pdf
/workflow.pdf

# Context-track provenance. These name the exact ENCODE accession behind every
# bigWig the epigenomic tower reads; the .bw files themselves stay ignored.
# Without these a cloner cannot tell which ENCODE experiment to download.
!data/reference/TRACK_SET.md
!data/reference/*/TRACK_SET.md

# local reproduction checks (REPRODUCE.md section 5.6 / 7)
repro_check/

